https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/301600bd-0de2-4137-85db-123cfc52b6ad\" />\n\nHowever, if I open up the project with compatability mode and switch the renderer to the Forward+, it works without any issues and when I start a blank game, it shows this in the debug log: \nGodot Engine v4.7.1.stable.steam.a13da4feb - https://godotengine.org\nD3D12 12_0 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 Ti\n\nMeaning my graphics card is supported. Im using the latest official Nvidia drivers and I've tried both Studio drivers and Game Ready drivers from the nvidia app.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the engine\n- Click on create new project\n- Switch from automatically selected compatability mode to Forward+\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIts a project creation issue, not a project issue.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121607/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121607/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}